100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[72,60,70,65,68,83],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[72,60,70,65,68,83],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,60,70,65,68,83],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,60,70,65,68,83],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,60,70,65,68,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,60,70,65,68,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"鲜卑宇文部首领，其父为宇文部开国单于宇文普回。宇文莫那最大的功绩是率领部落从阴山南迁至辽西，使部落从阴山无名别部发展为在辽西与慕容部、段部角逐的重要力量。其父临终叮嘱务必南迁。宇文莫那率部历时五年，抵达辽西老哈河上游，这一举措为宇文部的崛起奠定了基础。魏文帝曹丕在位时，曾册封其为单于；魏明帝曹叡时，宇文莫那因劝谏公孙渊被赏识，获赐土地。为应对当地势力，宇文莫那与拓跋部联姻结盟，后来北周称其国为魏舅甥之国。去世后，其子宇文莫槐继位。","tc":"鮮卑宇文部首領，其父為宇文部開國單于宇文普回。宇文莫那最大的功績是率領部落從陰山南遷至遼西，使部落從陰山無名別部發展為在遼西與慕容部、段部角逐的重要力量。其父臨終叮囑務必南遷。宇文莫那率部歷時五年，抵達遼西老哈河上游，這一舉措為宇文部的崛起奠定了基礎。魏文帝曹丕在位時，曾冊封其為單于；魏明帝曹叡時，宇文莫那因勸諫公孫淵被賞識，獲賜土地。為應對當地勢力，宇文莫那與拓跋部聯姻結盟，后來北周稱其國為魏舅甥之國。去世后，其子宇文莫槐繼位。","en":"A chieftain of the Yuwen branch of the Xianbei, whose father was Yuwen Puhui, the founding Chanyu of the Yuwen tribe. Yuwen Mona's greatest merit was leading his tribe to migrate south from Yinshan to Liaoxi, transforming them from an obscure branch in Yinshan into a major power contending with the Murong and Duan tribes in Liaoxi. On his deathbed, his father urged him to move south without fail. Mona led his people on a five-year trek to the upper reaches of the Laoha River in Liaoxi, laying the foundation for the rise of the Yuwen tribe. During the reign of Emperor Wen of Wei, Cao Pi, he was enfeoffed as Chanyu, under Emperor Ming of Wei, Cao Rui, Mona was commended for remonstrating with Gongsun Yuan and granted lands. To counter local rivals, Mona formed an alliance through marriage with the Tuoba tribe, Northern Zhou later referred to their state as being tied to Wei like nephews to maternal uncles. After his death, his son Yuwen Mohuai succeeded him.","jp":"鮮卑宇文部の首領。父は宇文部の開国単于・宇文普回。宇文莫那の最大の功績は、部族を率いて陰山から遼西へと南遷させ、陰山の名もなき別部から、遼西にて慕容部や段部と覇を争う重要勢力へと成長させたことである。父の遺言であった南遷を果たすべく、宇文莫那は部族を率いて5年の歳月をかけて遼西の老哈河上流へと到達し、この挙が宇文部台頭の礎となった。魏の文帝曹丕の治世には単于に冊封され、明帝曹叡の時代には公孫淵を諫めた功を認められ、土地を賜った。現地の諸勢力に対抗するため拓跋部と婚姻同盟を結び、後に北周ではその国を「魏舅甥の国」と称した。没後、子の宇文莫槐が跡を継いだ。","kr":"선비족 우문부의 수령으로, 아버지는 우문부의 개국 선우인 우문보회이다. 우문모나의 가장 큰 공적은 부족을 이끌고 음산에서 남쪽의 요서로 이주하여, 음산의 이름 없는 별부에 불과했던 부족을 요서에서 모용부, 단부와 패권을 다투는 주요 세력으로 성장시킨 것이다. 그의 아버지는 임종을 맞이하며 반드시 남쪽으로 이주하라는 유언을 남겼다. 우문모나가 부족을 이끌고 5년에 걸쳐 요서 노하하 상류에 당도하니, 이는 우문부가 굴기하는 굳건한 초석이 되었다. 위 문제 조비 재위 시절에는 선우로 책봉되었고, 위 명제 조예 시절에는 공손연에게 간언한 일로 신임을 얻어 토지를 하사받았다. 또한 현지 세력에 대응하고자 탁발부와 혼인 동맹을 맺었는데, 훗날 북주에서는 자국을 가리켜 위나라와 ‘외삼촌과 생질의 나라(舅甥之國)’라 칭하였다. 사망한 후에는 아들 우문모괴가 뒤를 이었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1047515","remark":"普武","surname":"宇文","surnameTc":"宇文","surnameEn":"Yuwen","surnameJp":"宇文","surnameKr":"우문","surnameOther":"","name":"莫那","nameTc":"莫那","nameEn":"Mona","nameJp":"莫那","nameKr":"모나","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"宇文莫那","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"188","city":"CS1076","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"60","wise":"70","politics":"65","charm":"68","will":"83","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"36/60/33/31/33/24/28/26","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5300","battleSoulPoint":"4300","debateSoulPoint":"5400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1010301;1001005;1001715","professions":"2/3/3/4/0/0/4/0/0/0/3/3/2/1/2/0/3/2/0/0/0/2/4/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"32","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3400","evaluate":"-1300","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"220","show":"234","death":"260","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","n